                                          'Fields:\n'
                                          'previews_per_client: Maximum independent frozen animation Previews owned by '
                                          'one client.\n'
                                          'preview_bytes: Conservative aggregate Preview storage limit, including '
                                          'replay/cache workspace.\n'
                                          'preview_schedule_entries: Maximum retained activations per Preview; Reset '
                                          'retains schedules.\n'
                                          'preview_seek_cache_bytes: SDK checkpoint-cache budget per Preview; '
                                          'transient replay state is charged separately.\n'
                                          'collection_records: Maximum records returned by one collection page or '
                                          'selected batch.\n'
                                          'collection_bytes: Maximum escaped metadata bytes in one collection page.\n'
                                          'collection_scan: Maximum entries examined by one collection page.\n'
                                          'clients: Maximum registered clients; this is a count, not a byte limit.\n'
                                          'sessions: Maximum resident document Sessions; this is a count, not a byte '
                                          'limit.\n'
                                          'edits_per_client_session: Maximum simultaneous candidates per '
                                          'client/Session pair; this is a count, not a byte limit.\n'
                                          'edits_per_session: Maximum simultaneous candidates per Session; this is a '
                                          'count, not a byte limit.\n'
                                          'edits_total: Maximum simultaneous candidates in this Runtime; this is a '
                                          'count, not a byte limit.\n'
                                          'candidate_bytes: Conservative byte limit for candidate document storage; '
                                          'not RSS or GPU memory.\n'
                                          'frozen_bytes: Conservative byte limit for frozen snapshots and queued work; '
                                          'not RSS or GPU memory.\n'
                                          'accounted_bytes: Conservative byte limit for aggregate Runtime-accounted '
                                          'storage; not RSS or GPU memory.\n'
                                          'image_bytes: Conservative byte limit for retained image storage; not RSS or '
                                          'GPU memory.\n'
                                          'plans_per_client: Maximum retained plans per client; this is a count, not a '
                                          'byte limit.\n'
                                          'references_per_client: Maximum retained object/field references per client; '
                                          'this is a count, not a byte limit.\n'
                                          'prepared_images_per_client: Maximum prepared images per client; this is a '
                                          'count, not a byte limit.\n'
                                          'plan_bytes: Conservative byte limit for retained plan storage; not RSS or '
                                          'GPU memory.\n'
                                          'blob_bytes: Conservative byte limit for retained binary blob storage; not '
                                          'RSS or GPU memory.\n'
                                          'blobs_per_client: Maximum retained binary blobs per client; this is a '
                                          'count, not a byte limit.\n'
                                          'history_bytes: Conservative byte limit for retained undo/redo history; not '
                                          'RSS or GPU memory.\n'
                                          'jobs_total: Maximum retained Jobs in the Runtime; this is a count, not a '
                                          'byte limit.\n'
                                          'jobs_per_client: Maximum retained Jobs per client; this is a count, not a '
                                          'byte limit.\n'
                                          'running_jobs: Maximum concurrently running host Jobs; this is a count, not '
                                          'a byte limit.\n'
                                          'session_events: Maximum retained events per Session stream; this is a '
