                                                  'independent relation.\n'
                                                  'strategy: Explicit reparenting/conversion strategy, including how '
                                                  'shape differences are preserved\n'
                                                  'or reported.\n'
                                                  'placement: Optional placement in the resulting deformation '
                                                  'collection.\n'
                                                  'tolerance: Absolute position error in model units, before Glue '
                                                  'postprocessing.\n'
                                                  'relative_tolerance: Relative error times the original affected '
                                                  "geometry's model-space scale.\n"
