                                              '\n'
                                              'Fields:\n'
                                              'id: Stable document object ID used by references; it is distinct from '
                                              'the exported runtime_id.\n'
                                              'runtime_id: External format/runtime identifier retained for '
                                              'import/export; not the document object ID.\n'
                                              'part_id: Organizational Part owner ID; independent of the deformation '
                                              'parent. An empty string\n'
                                              'represents the root/unassigned container.\n'
                                              'raw_blend_mode: Original format-specific blend-mode code; None means no '
                                              'preserved raw code.\n'
                                              'texture_asset_id: Resolved image-asset object ID used by this drawable; '
                                              'separate from its evaluated\n'
                                              'texture slot.\n'
                                              'texture_slot: Resolved texture slot index; separate from the persistent '
                                              'texture asset ID.\n'
                                              'renderable: Geometry remains editable when this resource cannot '
                                              'contribute color.\n'
                                              'positions: Final evaluated XY vertex positions in Y-up model units; '
                                              'ordered for indices and UVs.\n'
                                              'uvs: Texture UV pairs ordered by vertex_ids; keep one UV for each '
                                              'position.\n'
                                              'indices: Flattened triangle indices into evaluated positions/UVs; these '
                                              'are offsets, not\n'
                                              'authoring vertex IDs.\n'
                                              'draw_order: Evaluated integer drawing-order coordinate before final '
                                              'render sorting.\n'
                                              'render_order: Final evaluated drawing sequence rank after hierarchy and '
                                              'group ordering.\n'
                                              'opacity: Finite nonnegative opacity factor; 0 is transparent and 1 is '
                                              'opaque. Imported values\n'
                                              'above 1 are retained without clamping.\n'
                                              'multiply_color: Evaluated RGBA multiply factors, channel order R, G, B, '
                                              'A.\n'
                                              'screen_color: Evaluated RGBA screen factors, channel order R, G, B, A.\n'
                                              'blend_mode: Compositing mode used when drawing this object.\n'
                                              'enabled: Whether this object participates in evaluation; editor hiding '
                                              'is a separate state.\n'
                                              'visible: Whether the evaluated object is visible after hierarchical '
                                              'visibility rules.\n'
                                              'double_sided: Whether both triangle faces contribute to drawing.\n'
                                              'inverted_mask: Whether to invert the combined clipping mask for this '
                                              'drawable.\n'
                                              'masks: Ordered stable mesh IDs used as clipping-mask sources, not '
                                              'texture IDs.',
